  "historical_output_text": " Hi Jeanie!\n\nSo I thought I’d pop by quickly to just drop an uplifting line about our little corner over in our shared garden space. Just the other morning while the coffee brewed and birds were chirpy in that old will-o-the wick tree you’ve got near your back patio. It was the sun peek-a-boeing in from the eastern horizon and a gentle zing through all of us as we all got a fresh coat from a gentle morning rain! And, you guessed! There’s a sweet pea plant spruced and ready for action in a pot over to my side and it was blovin! So, in case it hadn' caught the corner in which I sit (literary), the world seems to want some more beauty these early mornings.\n\nTake in all that’s beautiful in the morning Jeanie - you’ll be happy you",
